### ProceedGate Billing + Governor (local)
### Assumes worker running at http://127.0.0.1:8788 with BILLING_MODE=credits
### Optional auth:
### - API_AUTH_MODE=off (default): no headers required
### - API_AUTH_MODE=shared: set API_SHARED_KEY and use Authorization: Bearer <key>
### - API_AUTH_MODE=workspace: set API_ADMIN_KEY to create workspace keys, then use Authorization: Bearer <workspaceKey>
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8788
@workspaceId = w1
@apiKey = PASTE_API_KEY_HERE
@adminKey = PASTE_ADMIN_KEY_HERE

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a credits top-up quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/quote
content-type: application/json
# authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}",
  "credits": 1000
}

### Check balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/balance?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
# authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Admin: create a workspace API key (only used when API_AUTH_MODE=workspace)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/create
content-type: application/json
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}"
}

### Admin: rotate workspace API key
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/rotate_key
content-type: application/json
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}"
}

### Admin: revoke workspace API key
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/revoke_key
content-type: application/json
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}"
}

### Admin: workspace key status
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/status?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

@adminSecret = PASTE_ADMIN_SECRET_HERE

### Admin: list all workspaces (all plans)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/workspaces
X-Admin-Secret: {{adminSecret}}

### Admin: list only Free plan workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/workspaces?plan=free
X-Admin-Secret: {{adminSecret}}

### Redeem a quote after paying USDC on Base
### 1) Paste quote_id from the quote response
### 2) Paste tx_hash from your wallet (Base mainnet)
@quoteId = q_PASTE_QUOTE_ID
@txHash = 0xPASTE_TX_HASH
# Dev shortcut (no real transaction): make it unique per quote
# @txHash = 0xstub:{{quoteId}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/redeem
content-type: application/json
# authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "quote_id": "{{quoteId}}",
  "tx_hash": "{{txHash}}"
}

### Governor check (uses actor.project as workspace id; consumes 1 credit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/governor/check
content-type: application/json
# authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "policy_id": "retry_friction_v1",
  "action": "model_call",
  "actor": {
    "id": "demo-actor",
    "project": "{{workspaceId}}"
  },
  "context": {
    "attempt_in_window": 1,
    "window_seconds": 600,
    "task_hash": "t1",
    "step_hash": "s1",
    "context_hash": "c1"
  }
}


### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Agent Identity (requires admin key)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all known agents (paginated, 20/page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### List agents — next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents?cursor=my-scraper-v2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Get agent profile + reputation by agent_id
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/agents/my-scraper-v2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Governor check with actor.wallet (ERC-8004 optional field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/governor/check
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "policy_id": "scraping_v1",
  "action": "fetch_url",
  "actor": {
    "id": "my-scraper-v2",
    "project": "{{workspaceId}}",
    "wallet": "0xYourAgentWalletAddress"
  },
  "context": {
    "attempt_in_window": 1
  }
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Webhooks (v1.2)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Configure webhook for real-time storm detection alerts
### Use https://webhook.site/ for testing
@webhookUrl = https://webhook.site/YOUR_UNIQUE_ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/{{workspaceId}}/webhook
content-type: application/json

{
  "webhook_url": "{{webhookUrl}}",
  "webhook_secret": "whsec_test_12345_abcdef",
  "events": ["storm.detected", "credits.low", "subscription.expiring"]
}

### Get webhook configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/{{workspaceId}}/webhook

### Trigger loop detection to test storm.detected webhook
### First, set webhook_url above, then run this repeatedly to trigger storm zone
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/billing/{{workspaceId}}/check-loop
content-type: application/json

{
  "pattern_hash": "sha256:test_pattern_abc",
  "window_ms": 60000,
  "max_count": 10,
  "cost_usd": 0.10
}
